// RUN: cd %corpus && ! %zomc compile --check 13-modules/module_initializer_unsupported_neg_25.zom > %t 2>&1
// RUN: %FileCheck %s --input-file %t

// A module-scope initializer whose expression the checker has no semantic
// contract for is ordinary unsupported source, not a compiler invariant.
// `typeof` is a well-typed expression form with no constant-folding producer,
// so it reports ZOM4104. A genuine type error (e.g. `true + false`) is a
// separate case covered by module_initializer_bad_operands_neg_26.

// CHECK-LITERAL: Error [ZOM4104]: compile-time evaluation of this module-scope value is not supported yet
// CHECK-LITERAL:   --> conformance/13-modules/module_initializer_unsupported_neg_25.zom:1:13
